sequenceDiagram
    actor User as SME User
    participant Browser as Browser UI
    participant App as Streamlit App
    participant Prep as Preprocessing
    participant Forecast as Forecasting
    participant Anomaly as Anomaly Detection
    participant Viz as Visualization
    participant Export as CSV Export Utility

    User->>Browser: Open dashboard
    Browser->>App: Request page
    App-->>Browser: Render controls and tabs

    alt Upload CSV
        User->>Browser: Upload file + map columns
        Browser->>App: Send file and mapping
    else Use sample dataset
        User->>Browser: Select bundled sample
        Browser->>App: Send sample choice
    end

    App->>Prep: Validate, clean, aggregate
    Prep-->>App: Cleaned frame + quality report

    App->>Forecast: Train and evaluate models
    Forecast-->>App: MAE/MAPE + future forecast

    App->>Anomaly: Detect outliers with rolling z-score
    Anomaly-->>App: Anomaly flags and stats

    App->>Viz: Build charts and KPI cards
    Viz-->>Browser: Display metrics and plots

    User->>Browser: Request exports
    Browser->>App: Trigger export action
    App->>Export: Build downloadable CSV files
    Export-->>Browser: Return export streams
